35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The treasurer spent six hours a month chasing money. That is too much.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,The ledger shows seventy percent is fixed costs. Bank statements show late payments.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minako,,Nine people left because they did not want a whole year commitment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,Turnout fell by a third after the door charge. People stopped feeling it was theirs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,A quarter of members do two-thirds of the work. Eighteen never show up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Ryuji, if we charge per event, the chasing time goes up.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,Yes. Fixed costs are high. We need reliable income.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minako,,So a flat fee might be best? It is simple.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,But it feels unfair if some people never come.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,It is unfair if the same nine do everything.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,I worry about the admin burden. Flat fee is easiest.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Predictable income covers the fixed costs.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,I am concerned about newcomers. They need to drift in.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"If it is too expensive, they will not come.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,We need to balance fairness and simplicity.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
